The '''Kitonak'''<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with [[Color|pink]] skin and small [[eye]]s<ref name="ROTJ" /> that was [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] [[Kirdo III]]. Their bodies released a [[vanilla]]-like scent. They boasted thick, leathery skin, which allowed them to adapt to harsh climates<ref name="Alien Archive" /> as their tough skin protected them from the [[Star|sun]].<ref name="VE" />

The [[musician]] [[Droopy McCool]] from [[Kirdo III]] was a Kitonak. His true name was a series of whistles only pronounceable by other Kitonaks.<ref name="AEYNTK" />

A colony of Kitonaks was rumored to exist on [[Tatooine]], near [[Mos Eisley]].<ref name="SWCL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref>

[[Thaddeeus Marien]] was a male Kitonak who lived in the [[Reestkii]] settlement on [[Jakku]].<ref name="ACGAS">{{StoryCite|story=All Creatures Great and Small|book=Tales from a Galaxy Far, Far Away: Aliens: Volume I}}</ref>

